  "html": "\n<div align=\"center\"><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\" width=\"630\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td height=\"10\" width=\"630\"><p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;</span></font></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td background=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/memo_t.gif\" height=\"25\" width=\"630\"><p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;<img border=\"0\" height=\"17\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/tips_logo.gif\" width=\"200\"></span></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td background=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/memo_m.gif\" height=\"39\" width=\"630\"> <p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;</span></font></p>\n<table align=\"center\" border=\"1\" bordercolordark=\"#666666\" bordercolorlight=\"black\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\" width=\"600\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td background=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/alpha_background.gif\" colspan=\"2\" height=\"30\" width=\"594\">\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;<b><img align=\"absbottom\" border=\"0\" data-original-src=\"http://forg.co.kr:80/dungeon/image/F.gif\" data-recovery=\"missing\" height=\"30\" src=\"/img/placeholder/missing-slot.svg\" style=\"aspect-ratio:30/30\" width=\"30\">IRE \n                            DUNGEON(파이어던전)</b></span></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"290\">\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"280\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/dungeon/firedungeon_map.gif\" width=\"320\"></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"300\">\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:5;\"><font color=\"maroon\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><b>던전설명 \n                                        :</b></span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:5;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">셔펜드홀드[Serpent's \n                            Hold]마을에서</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:5;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">부두쪽으로 \n                            진행하시면 파이어던전을 만날 수</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:5;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">있습니다.</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:5;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">던전으로 \n                            들어가시면 불의 기운을 바로 느끼실</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:5;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">수 \n                            있습니다. 또한 던전입구에서 조금만 진행</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:5;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">하시면 \n                            잃어버린대륙(T2A)으로 워프하는 장소도</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:5;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">있습니다.</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:5;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">-----------------------------------------------</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><img align=\"absmiddle\" border=\"0\" height=\"11\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/icon_1.gif\" width=\"11\"><img align=\"absmiddle\" border=\"0\" height=\"11\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/icon_2.gif\" width=\"11\"><img align=\"absmiddle\" border=\"0\" height=\"11\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/icon_3.gif\" width=\"11\"> \n                                        : 던전이동지역</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">(같은 모양의 아이콘끼리 \n                                        이동됩니다)</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"9\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/icon_4.gif\" width=\"13\"> \n                                        : 비밀문이나 잠김문</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><img align=\"absmiddle\" border=\"0\" height=\"11\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/icon_5.gif\" width=\"11\"> \n                                        : 던전내 중요 지점</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">(클릭 하시면 상세정보를 \n                                        보실 수 있습니다)</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">----------------------------------------------</span></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" height=\"359\" width=\"594\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:50%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<table align=\"center\" bordercolordark=\"white\" bordercolorlight=\"black\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\" width=\"499\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td width=\"499\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"320\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/dungeon/firedungeon_1.gif\" usemap=\"#ImageMap3\" width=\"390\"></span></font></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"maroon\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><b>던전입구</b></span></font></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"purple\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">입구로 \n                                        들어가게 되면 다소 복잡한 던전구조를 \n                                        느끼실 수 있습니다. <img align=\"absmiddle\" border=\"0\" height=\"11\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/icon_2.gif\" width=\"11\">지점은 \n                                        T2A지역으로</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"purple\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">워프되는 \n                                        곳입니다. 중요지점에서는 로프[Rope]위를 \n                                        지나갈 수도 있습니다.</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><b>주요 \n                                        몬스터 :</b></font></span><a href=\"/site/dungeon/Lizard_man/\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><b> </b></font></span></a><a href=\"/site/dungeon/Rat/\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\">Giant \n                                        Rat(큰쥐)</font></span></a><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">, \n                                        </span></font><a href=\"/site/dungeon/Slime/\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\">Slime(슬라임)</font></span></a><a href=\"/site/dungeon/Lizard_man/\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\">,<b>\n</b></font></span></a><a href=\"/site/dungeon/HellCat/\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\">HellCat(헬캣)</font></span></a><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">, \n                                        </span></font><a href=\"/site/dungeon/Giant_Serpent/\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\">Giant \n                                        Serpent(큰뱀)</font></span></a><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">,&nbsp;</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><a href=\"/site/dungeon/Hell_Hound/\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\">Hell \n                                        Hound(헬하운드)</font></span></a><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"> \n                                        , </span></font><a href=\"/site/dungeon/Lava_Serpent/\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\">Lava \n                                        Serpent(라바셔펜트)</font></span></a><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">, \n                                        </span></font><a href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20030902151242/http://forg.co.kr:80/dungeon/Lich.html\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\">Lich(리치)</font></span></a><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">, \n                                        </span></font><a href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20030902151242/http://forg.co.kr:80/dungeon/Efreet.html\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\">Efreet(이프리트)</font></span></a></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><a href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20030902151242/http://forg.co.kr:80/dungeon/Skeletal%20Mage.html\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\">Skeletal \n                                        Mage(스켈레톤 메이지)</font></span></a><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">, \n                                        </span></font><a href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20030902151242/http://forg.co.kr:80/dungeon/Bone%20Mage.html\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\">Bone \n                                        Mage(본 메이지)</font></span></a><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">, \n                                        </span></font><a href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20030902151242/http://forg.co.kr:80/dungeon/Lava%20Snake.html\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\">Lava \n                                        Snake(라바스네이크)</font></span></a><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"> \n                                        , </span></font><a href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20030902151242/http://forg.co.kr:80/dungeon/Fire%20Elemental.html\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\">Fire&nbsp;Elemental(파이어엘리)</font></span></a><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">,&nbsp;</span></font><a href=\"/site/dungeon/Lava_Lizard/\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\">Lava \n                                        Lizard(라바리자드)</font></span></a><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"> \n                                        , </span></font><a href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20030902151242/http://forg.co.kr:80/dungeon/Evil%20Mage.html\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\">Evil \n                            Mage(머더러메이지)</font></span></a></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/l_line.gif\" width=\"30\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" heigh